# Hand-written, checked in: the DeviceActivityMonitorExtension base config.
# Its neighbours under Flutter/ are tool-generated and ignored above, so make the
# exception explicit — a future "Flutter/*.xcconfig" rule would otherwise strand
# three baseConfigurationReference pointers on a file no fresh clone has.
!Flutter/Extension.xcconfig
